From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
dcomp: three-dimensional transforms

The version 1 device creates translate, scale, rotate and matrix 3D
transforms and groups of them, validated like the two-dimensional ones,
and effect groups take them. The IDL of IDCompositionRotateTransform3D was a
copy of the scale transform's; it now has angle, axis and center methods.
